menu "OTA Suite update checks"
    config OTA_SUITE_UPDATE_MANIFEST_URL
        string "Fixed firmware manifest URL"
        default "https://updates.example.org/firmware.json"
        help
            Only the manifest is fetched automatically. Images must be in the same
            directory and origin as this URL and named <project>-<version>.bin.
            HTTP requires OTA_SUITE_OTA_ALLOW_HTTP; HTTPS requires valid CA/date checks.
endmenu
